I have implemented Callkit with JitsiMeet, I m unable to mute the audio through the callkit UI.
SDK version used : 2.5.0

Method Used: 

 func performSetMutedCall(UUID: UUID, isMuted: Bool){
        let callMutedAction = CXSetMutedCallAction(call: UUID, muted: isMuted)
        let transaction = CXTransaction(action: callMutedAction)
        
        JMCallKitProxy.request(transaction) { (error) in
            print(error?.localizedDescription)
        }
    }

Please suggest something for implementing this, i want to mute the jitsi call using callkit UI button
